AI and Algorithmic Ethics
Scope & Core Inquiries: How responsibly does this company develop, deploy, or utilize artificial intelligence, machine learning, and automated decision-making systems? Do its algorithms perpetuate or amplify racial, gender, or socioeconomic bias in high-stakes domains such as hiring screenings, facial recognition, credit lending, or insurance underwriting? Does it scrape intellectual property, creative works, and personal data without licenses or consent to train generative AI models? Do its recommendation algorithms exploit psychological vulnerabilities to induce compulsive use and mental health harms (particularly among youth)? Does it rely on opaque automated systems for disciplinary actions, employee surveillance, or mass layoffs?